MODULE: ExpiredMirrorReleasedMirrorKept
TARGET: ExpiredMirrorReleased
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: retirement releases undo admission while a shard-for-shard mirror remains
PERTURBS: ExpireUndo

--- FIND
    /\ undoable' = FALSE /\ mirror' = FALSE
--- REPLACE
    /\ undoable' = FALSE /\ mirror' = TRUE
--- END
